<title>NETHERLANDS: Hagemeyer shares surge on profit rise, stock split.</title>
<headline>Hagemeyer shares surge on profit rise, stock split.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hagemeyer NV reversed earlier session losses to trade up 1.60 guilders at 164.80 after the trading company announced 1996 profits up 47.5 percent and said it would mount a two-for-one share split.</p>
<p>Full-year profits came in at 285.2 million guilders, at the upper end of the forecast range.</p>
<p>The shares had been trading down some three guilders prior to the announcement, just off the day's low of 159.00.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
